(7147475, 1096018, 58667, '<td valign="top">Sure it''s Jupiter? It looks a lot like Venus to me. At the moment Jupiter at that height would be in the north east. And being Venus, the title could have been something to do with the evening <b>star</b>... :) I could be mistaken. A very beautiful photo indeed.<br/> <br/>And to correct my comment of earlier - Jupiter is far from the moon. Time has flown and the moon rises much later now.<br/> <br/>Not voting.</td>', 'Sure it''s Jupiter? It looks a lot like Venus to me. At the moment Jupiter at that height would be in the north east. And being Venus, the title could have been something to do with the evening star... :) I could be mistaken. A very beautiful photo indeed. And to correct my comment of earlier - Jupiter is far from the moon. Time has flown and the moon rises much later now. Not voting.', '2013-12-26 08:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
