(7148027, 1095789, 15711, '<td valign="top">It almost looks surreal, yet it''s grounded by the bench.  Lovely!!</td>', 'It almost looks surreal, yet it''s grounded by the bench.  Lovely!!', '2013-12-27 08:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148028, 1096005, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great kitty portrait.  I have such an affinity for orange tabbies.  Had one for 15 years, and now we have another one. ;)</td>', 'Great kitty portrait.  I have such an affinity for orange tabbies.  Had one for 15 years, and now we have another one. ;)', '2013-12-27 08:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148031, 1096127, 15711, '<td valign="top">FUN.  Now I''m hungry. ;)</td>', 'FUN.  Now I''m hungry. ;)', '2013-12-27 08:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148032, 1095668, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity and hint of soft.  Very pretty.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity and hint of soft.  Very pretty.', '2013-12-27 08:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148034, 1096013, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the stark contrasts.  Your eye moves around the image and lands on the guy with his glasses. :)</td>', 'I like the stark contrasts.  Your eye moves around the image and lands on the guy with his glasses. :)', '2013-12-27 08:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148035, 1096023, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like it.  Simple. Quietly moving. :)</td>', 'I really like it.  Simple. Quietly moving. :)', '2013-12-27 08:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148037, 1096106, 15711, '<td valign="top">Would you like to swing on a star?  Carry moonbeams home in a jar... Everything reminds me of lyrics to a song.  Thanks for the reminder of a classic. :)7</td>', 'Would you like to swing on a star?  Carry moonbeams home in a jar... Everything reminds me of lyrics to a song.  Thanks for the reminder of a classic. :)7', '2013-12-27 08:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148038, 1096044, 15711, '<td valign="top">Rob?  Pinwheels!!!  I like.</td>', 'Rob?  Pinwheels!!!  I like.', '2013-12-27 08:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148066, 1095719, 172889, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect</td>', 'Very cool effect', '2013-12-27 09:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148211, 1096045, 173844, '<td valign="top">And here I thought it was complicated...  Lovely ocean-like environment, with krill.</td>', 'And here I thought it was complicated...  Lovely ocean-like environment, with krill.', '2013-12-27 14:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148214, 1096118, 173844, '<td valign="top">The manipulation of exposure highlights this straightforward ornament.</td>', 'The manipulation of exposure highlights this straightforward ornament.', '2013-12-27 14:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148215, 1096133, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fanciful stars or rime, still an enjoyable vision for the challenge.  I like how they clump and flutter.</td>', 'Fanciful stars or rime, still an enjoyable vision for the challenge.  I like how they clump and flutter.', '2013-12-27 14:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148216, 1096063, 173844, '<td valign="top">The Ginger Rogers of stars, steppin'' out.  The reflection adds gracefully to this image.</td>', 'The Ginger Rogers of stars, steppin'' out.  The reflection adds gracefully to this image.', '2013-12-27 14:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148217, 1096135, 173844, '<td valign="top">The purple stones seem to twinkle.</td>', 'The purple stones seem to twinkle.', '2013-12-27 14:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148218, 1095612, 173844, '<td valign="top">Curiously pleasing assemblage of disparate elements.</td>', 'Curiously pleasing assemblage of disparate elements.', '2013-12-27 14:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148219, 1095622, 173844, '<td valign="top">I think I see ursas major and minor.</td>', 'I think I see ursas major and minor.', '2013-12-27 14:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148220, 1096005, 173844, '<td valign="top">And pampered too, I''ll bet.  I can''t resist pet pictures.</td>', 'And pampered too, I''ll bet.  I can''t resist pet pictures.', '2013-12-27 14:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148221, 1096115, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like entering hyperspace at technocolor warp speed.  Onward and outward!</td>', 'I like entering hyperspace at technocolor warp speed.  Onward and outward!', '2013-12-27 14:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148222, 1096075, 173844, '<td valign="top">I love the title and will take your word on content.</td>', 'I love the title and will take your word on content.', '2013-12-27 14:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148223, 1096013, 173844, '<td valign="top">You''ve caught him after hours when no one''s looking.  I like this.</td>', 'You''ve caught him after hours when no one''s looking.  I like this.', '2013-12-27 15:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148224, 1096036, 173844, '<td valign="top">The star is well realized.  It''s fun to view this in a ''take us to your leader'' fashion; the dawn of a new era.</td>', 'The star is well realized.  It''s fun to view this in a ''take us to your leader'' fashion; the dawn of a new era.', '2013-12-27 15:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148231, 1096113, 173844, '<td valign="top">I''ve been lingering over this beautiful scene, drawn in by both heavens and earth.  Who drove this truck, how''d it come to rest here?  It engages senses and emotions.  My favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'I''ve been lingering over this beautiful scene, drawn in by both heavens and earth.  Who drove this truck, how''d it come to rest here?  It engages senses and emotions.  My favorite in the challenge.', '2013-12-27 15:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148233, 1096044, 173844, '<td valign="top">An attractive confection.  It looks like it took a lot of effort.  Thank you for putting it all together.</td>', 'An attractive confection.  It looks like it took a lot of effort.  Thank you for putting it all together.', '2013-12-27 15:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148235, 1096114, 173844, '<td valign="top">A beautiful view of the heavens.</td>', 'A beautiful view of the heavens.', '2013-12-27 15:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148237, 1095668, 173844, '<td valign="top">That''s a provocative pose for a skinny star.</td>', 'That''s a provocative pose for a skinny star.', '2013-12-27 15:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148238, 1096018, 173844, '<td valign="top">Also some stars.  Lovely time of day.</td>', 'Also some stars.  Lovely time of day.', '2013-12-27 15:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148239, 1096127, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sometimes stars are cold and distant.  These are homey and intimate and welcoming.  It feels good inside.</td>', 'Sometimes stars are cold and distant.  These are homey and intimate and welcoming.  It feels good inside.', '2013-12-27 15:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148240, 1095992, 173844, '<td valign="top">This decoration seems homemade and beloved, trailed by treasured memories.</td>', 'This decoration seems homemade and beloved, trailed by treasured memories.', '2013-12-27 15:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148242, 1095736, 173844, '<td valign="top">A dead star, a huge and unnoticed cinder in outer space, tiny but noticed and appreciated on our earth.</td>', 'A dead star, a huge and unnoticed cinder in outer space, tiny but noticed and appreciated on our earth.', '2013-12-27 15:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148245, 1096109, 173844, '<td valign="top">An exotic, mysterious feel to this star in its reddened setting.</td>', 'An exotic, mysterious feel to this star in its reddened setting.', '2013-12-27 15:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148246, 1096017, 173844, '<td valign="top">The person lost in thought and the sculpted people are suitably oblivious.  Can''t show off if no one''s looking.  Accompanied by these grace notes, I like it.</td>', 'The person lost in thought and the sculpted people are suitably oblivious.  Can''t show off if no one''s looking.  Accompanied by these grace notes, I like it.', '2013-12-27 15:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148247, 1096116, 173844, '<td valign="top">I love this scene of fireworks(?) before the burnished, elegant tableau, bristling with staircases and one diffident person.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'I love this scene of fireworks(?) before the burnished, elegant tableau, bristling with staircases and one diffident person.  One of my favorites.', '2013-12-27 16:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148248, 1095789, 173844, '<td valign="top">I really like this lit up corridor of primitive-looking trees leading past a highlighted bench to an indeterminate destination.  I can make believe that those are shooting stars and not contrails.</td>', 'I really like this lit up corridor of primitive-looking trees leading past a highlighted bench to an indeterminate destination.  I can make believe that those are shooting stars and not contrails.', '2013-12-27 16:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148249, 1096124, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and a star-spangled sky from within a handsome grove --- what''s not to like?</td>', 'Lovely colors and a star-spangled sky from within a handsome grove --- what''s not to like?', '2013-12-27 16:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148250, 1095581, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wow! Hard to believe such stylized scenery is real.  A deceptively simple, extraordinary image.</td>', 'Wow! Hard to believe such stylized scenery is real.  A deceptively simple, extraordinary image.', '2013-12-27 16:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148256, 1095548, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes, exactly.  Kudos for expressing this feeling exceptionally well through bokeh, and hewing to the challenge in a totally novel way.</td>', 'Yes, exactly.  Kudos for expressing this feeling exceptionally well through bokeh, and hewing to the challenge in a totally novel way.', '2013-12-27 16:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148259, 1096120, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nicely crafted.  The incendiary implications are very playful.</td>', 'Nicely crafted.  The incendiary implications are very playful.', '2013-12-27 16:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
